feat(ptm): add Polyhedral Template Matching

Vendor the PTM C++ library (MIT, Larsen et al. MSMSE 2016) into
lib/ptm/ and integrate with pyscal3 via a pybind11 wrapper.

New function polyhedral_template_matching() identifies 8 structure
types: FCC, HCP, BCC, ICO, SC, diamond cubic, diamond hex, graphene.

Outputs per atom: structure type, RMSD, orientation quaternion,
interatomic distance, lattice constant, alloy type.

- C++ wrapper (ptm_wrapper.cpp) implements PTM neighbor callback
  using pyscal3's displacement-vector neighbor data
- Automatic neighbor finding (18 nearest) if not pre-computed
- Configurable structure checks and RMSD cutoff
- 15 tests (perfect crystals, noisy, parameter validation)
- Example notebook 19_polyhedral_template_matching.ipynb
